# 94
#title Show the guide inside the PR review screen
#url https://github.com/MobileReality/lantern/pull/94
#branch feat/guide-in-review
#base feat/guided-review
#opened 2026-11-27
#head 34881690ce6a9c95008f5fa9e3eb29f5774c02d9
#describe what A pull request with a guide is reviewed on the normal review screen: the steps replace the file list on the left, the middle shows one file's diff with its step's title and why, and the arrow keys walk the files in guide order.
#describe what The Guide button and the separate Guide view are removed; Flow and Macro are unchanged and a record without a guide behaves as before.
#describe before A Guide tile switched the whole area to one long scroll of hunks.
#describe after Picking a file in a step, or stepping with the arrows, opens that file's diff in the middle with the lines the step names marked.
#describe verified Typecheck, lint, the unit suite and the pull request review e2e specs all pass.
